Package: crewquarters
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Crewquarters <crewquarters@localhost>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), adduser, iptables, curl, zstd, openssl
Recommends: docker-ce | docker.io, docker-compose-plugin | docker-compose-v2
Homepage: https://github.com/nikhil-ghind/crewquarters
Description: Crewquarters - your own local AI crew
 Local AI-agent platform for NVIDIA GB10 / DGX Spark-class appliances. Installs the
 host runtime daemon (the only component with Docker access), the administration CLI,
 systemd units, the appliance Compose stack, the pinned model catalog, and a desktop
 launcher. Model downloads, credentials and agent setup happen in the browser.
